<blockquote>
<p>Forum critique should be relatively in-depth.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Try to make sure you give enough criticism that an author can tell the quality of their entire concept/draft. How will your suggestion help to improve the concept? What do you personally think about the concept as a whole? Is there something within the concept you feel could be improved on? How well are the genres presented within the idea?</p>
<p>If you need more assistance with writing a concept review, please consider referring to this thread for guidance: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-9804362/so-you-want-to-be-a-concept-reviewer">http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-9804362/so-you-want-to-be-a-concept-reviewer</a></p>

